      "statement": "The regional task definition combines an EFS-backed home with empty task-scoped OCM and kubeconfig overlays, and the entrypoint's verify_credential_mounts/initialize_credential_mounts functions refuse missing or EFS-backed overlays (failing startup if either path is not a task-scoped, non-NFS mount) before launching the workload as sre.",
