    {
      "id": "claim_cef635918fde49daae5cf0282a34e52b",
      "statement": "On shutdown the container's cleanup function stops the background skill reconciler and then invokes sync_to_s3 under an outer watchdog timeout; sync_to_s3 runs a bounded, time-boxed `aws s3 sync /home/sre` that excludes the OCM config and kubeconfig credential overlays and never follows symlinks. Independently, the reap-tasks Lambda checks per-task deadline tags on its own schedule and defers stopping a task that has an active ECS Exec/SSM session.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L21-L56",
