      "statement": "cmd/rosa-boundary/main.go is a minimal entrypoint that only calls cmd.Execute(); the Boundary CLI's Go module is github.com/openshift-online/rosa-boundary (go 1.26.0, toolchain go1.27.4), a module entirely separate from the independently versioned components/trusted-actions Go module.",
