    {
      "id": "claim_b55af256c8184effa2d84cfb2373b4ad",
      "statement": "The root Containerfile builds the ECS Fargate operator image as nine stages (tools-base, sre-tools, claude-builder, opencode-builder, codex-builder, pi-builder, search-builder, tmux-builder, final); every stage except final only fetches and checksum/signature-verifies tool or coding-agent binaries (one dedicated builder stage per coding agent, plus search-builder for fd/ripgrep), and final is the only stage that ships, copying verified outputs from the other eight and installing entrypoint.sh as ENTRYPOINT with CMD defaulting to sleep infinity.",
